From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dynamic Devices <engineering@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 18:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] LEGACY ONLY: implementation-only GBM native window override

Do not apply this patch. Retained only so do_compile can reverse it on source
trees left by earlier builds, without invalidating do_unpack and all objects.

On Chromium 147, Wayland callers select intptr_t through USE_OZONE. Including
gbm.h only in the core GL implementation instead selects void*, producing a
different NativeViewGLSurfaceEGL constructor symbol. Target 3008 failed to link
the caller's expected long constructor. Fresh trees must retain the upstream
include order; reused trees must remove this override and rebuild that object.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [i.MX Wayland GBM product configuration]

---
 ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc b/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
index abcd123..abcd124 100644
--- a/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
+++ b/ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.cc
@@ -5 +5,3 @@
+#include <gbm.h>
+
 #include "ui/gl/gl_surface_egl.h"
